# Conformance probe pack for presence bits named only inside cases of group
# items (spec 0.20, ruling 36), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   presence p 8              a message presence
#   recs, count 8; each item: x : 8, then by x
#     1     if p.1: y : 8
#     2     if p.2: z : 8
#     else  nothing
#
# A bit named only inside cases is satisfied by such a case read anywhere
# later in the same decode, a later item included. On encode any item with
# the content sets the bit (ruling 12 of 0.8).
format     conformance-kinds-across
version    0.20.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence p 8
group  probe.recs  count 8
  field  probe.x  8  uint
  switch probe.x
    case 1
      if p.1
        field  probe.y  8  uint
      end
    case 2
      if p.2
        field  probe.z  8  uint
      end
    else
  end
end
